This repository combines research materials with retained source provenance.
No new blanket license is assigned to the combined repository.

The license text present in the taylor-kenyon source snapshot is retained at:
    licenses/taylor_kenyon_apache_2_0.txt

Original authorship and source notices remain in the imported files. The
archived rjost1 dilution branch did not contain a standalone license file.
See docs/provenance.md and docs/source_manifest.csv for per-source details.
